Bugfix: The market app is enabled right after the installation

A new installation registered apps-external as an app directory only after the
bundled apps had been installed. The installer therefore did not see the market
app there, and it stayed disabled until the first update ran occ upgrade. The
app directories are now registered first and are known to the running
installation, so occ maintenance:install and the web installer enable the
market app, as the installation guide describes.
